+- `evidence/14-reject-false-derived-lemma.log`
+- `evidence/15-stage3-stage4-semantic-audit.log`
+- `evidence/16-final-mechanical-gate.log`
+
+VERDICT: PASS
+LEGITIMACY: LEGIT
